<TIME=1200>
<LOCKED=False>
<DESCRIPTION=COBOL PROGRAM>
</REVDATA>
<DATA=Options>
  Name=ASSURFED-UTILIT-CONDIS2-GN
  Description=COBOL PROGRAM
  Parameter=
</DATA>
<DATA=Code>
  2009-01-01 12:00  => IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* SSG-4 (MT-043): one CONDIS2 for every call. Conditions
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* (PG CASE / OTHERWISE), field moves (PG MOVE, date conversions)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* and constants (PG CONST) come from the SGSPARM file written by
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* the skeleton hand-off; see Generic\CONDIS2\spec.md.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => PROGRAM-ID. 'ASSURFED-UTILIT-CONDIS2-GN'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => CONFIGURATION SECTION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => SOURCE-COMPUTER. UNIVAC-1100-10.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => OBJECT-COMPUTER. UNIVAC-1100-10.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FILE-CONTROL.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     SELECT PARMF ASSIGN TO DISC SGSPARM.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     SELECT FI1 ASSIGN TO DISC FILEIN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     SELECT FO1 ASSIGN TO DISC FILEOUT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => DATA DIVISION.
