  * titles) for every call. Record shapes, field moves and the title
  * come from the SGSPARM file written by the skeleton hand-off; see
  * _scratch\spike-tapeld\spec.md. Statements as the skeleton.
  PROGRAM-ID. .
  -MAPEND-
  -MAP-
